		    documentation 	
|(Euclidean Metric)^2
|	 * Special Case of the p-Metric for p = 2
|	 * Rotation Invariant for cartesian Systems.	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "arg"
			    type       	"Object"))
