		    quid       	"37BD38DC0324"
		    documentation 	
|Euklidische Norm
|	 * Special Case of the p-Norm for p = 2
|	 * Rotation Invariant in cartesian Systems.	 
		    
		    result     	"MetricIRing"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
