		(object ClassAttribute "bolLazySimplify"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"36BB4A12028E"
		    documentation 	
|Switches Simplifying of the Results and Arguments on or off.
|	 * It is typically switched on, since you can not expect the result
|	 * to be a  real, integer or of less Degree than the argument. 
|	 * With the following Objects it controls the following:
|	 * Fraction	: shortening (except where it is necessary)
|	 * Complex	: Checking for real Result or argument
|	 * Polar	: Checking for real Result or argument
|	 * Polynom	: Checking for Zero in the upper Coefficients	 
		    
		    type       	"boolean"
		    initv      	"true"
		    exportControl 	"Protected"
		    static     	TRUE)
