		(object Attribute
		    tool       	"Java"
		    name       	"GenerateDefaultConstructor"
		    value      	FALSE))
	    quid       	"37BC91AD029F"
	    documentation 	
|Quality Stepper Algorithm:
| * Extends Stepping for a Solution in a 1-dim Varable Space 
| * by bounding the Zero Position (continuous f)
| * and iterating until the Zero is hit in x AND y Direction. 
| * Requires f to be continuous. 
| * The Stepper Routine should keep the right Function Value positive. 
| * 
| * inheriting Classes are:
| * FalsiStepQ
| * NewtonStepQ
| * PegasusStep 
| * 
| * These Descendants are used in MultiStepYQ 
| * which does a faster Check for Convergence relying on (yr > 0).	 
	    
	    superclasses 	(list inheritance_relationship_list
		(object Inheritance_Relationship
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38DE0376"
		    supplier   	"Logical View::Ring::FalsiStep"
		    quidu      	"37BC91AD02A9"))
	    operations 	(list Operations
		(object Operation "Init"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38DE0380"
		    documentation 	
|Initializes the Stepper	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "xl_"
			    type       	"IntegrityRing")
			(object Parameter "xr_"
			    type       	"IntegrityRing")
			(object Parameter "f_"
			    type       	"intFunction"))
		    result     	"void"
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "absRefinerQ"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38DE0384"
		    documentation 	
|Initializing Constructor. 
|	 * The Zero of the Function f must be bracketed in the Interval x!
|	 * The Stepper should keep the Zero bracketed! 
|	 * yr is kept positive!	 
		    
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0)
		(object Operation "absRefinerQ"
		    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
		    quid       	"37BD38DE0385"
		    documentation 	
|Initializing Constructor. 
|	 * The Zero of the Function f must be bracketed in the Interval x!
|	 * The Stepper should keep the Zero bracketed! 
|	 * yr is kept positive!	 
		    
		    parameters 	(list Parameters
			(object Parameter "xl_"
			    type       	"MetricIRing")
			(object Parameter "xr_"
			    type       	"MetricIRing")
			(object Parameter "f_"
			    type       	"intFunction"))
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
		    opExportControl 	"Public"
		    uid        	0))
